# {{PRODUCT}} — GitHub Copilot path instructions

Follow the repo-root `AGENTS.md` and `.agents/rules/harness-rules.md`. The rules file wins.

- Run harness scripts with `{{PY}}`
- Assemble: `{{PY}} .agents/scripts/run_gradle_task.py {{ASSEMBLE}}`
- Harness Execution Boundary: Installed harness engine source under `.agents/scripts/**` is an implementation detail. Execute documented commands directly; do not inspect or recursively read harness Python implementation before execution.
- Device: {{DEVICE_POLICY}}
- Discovery: MUST start with targeted task context (`{{PY}} .agents/harness.py task-context --file <path> --json` or `--symbol <name>`) or architectural graph (`{{PY}} .agents/scripts/project_graph.py --feature <name>` or `--find <Symbol>`). Unanchored repository-wide grep cascades are forbidden; targeted search within feature directories is permitted.
- Consultation & Edge Case Discussion Before Planning: If the user asks to study/research missing scenarios, surface edge cases before starting, or asks for architectural confirmation, fully discuss and present the breakdown directly in plain chat BEFORE drafting any plan.
- Strict Verification Order: Preflight -> unit tests -> routed reviewers -> device install -> mobile walkthrough -> verify. Diagnostic assemble is allowed during IMPLEMENTING. Before the final delivery assemble, obtain every reviewer verdict selected by central policy; self-certification by the lead agent is forbidden.
- Finding Adjudication: Adjudicate false positives via `{{PY}} .agents/scripts/workflow.py validate-finding --repo . --task-id <id> --finding-id <id> --status FALSE_POSITIVE --reason "<rationale>"`.
- Zero-Polling Invariant: Never poll background tasks or subagents in a loop. Yield execution and wait for reactive messages.
- 5-Tier Adaptive Execution: Tier 0 (NANO: strings, docs) and Tier 1 (VISUAL_ANALYTICS: UI styling, clicks <= 8 files in 1 module) select REVIEWERS=NONE; Tier 2 (FEATURE_LOGIC): 1 reviewer; Tier 3 (SUBSYSTEM_ARCH): 2 reviewers; Tier 4 (CRITICAL_CORE: Room, Auth, Billing): Full Five-Leaf Review.
- Mobile Verification Walkthrough: After device installation (`run_device.py install-start`), the agent MUST output a complete, numbered test walkthrough (Navigation path, Preconditions, User actions, Expected results, Edge cases) in chat before asking for verification.
- {{GIT_POLICY}}
